          "text": {
            "type": "string",
            "value": "TRIM\n\nThe Trim node enables you to cut of parts of your content, adjusting the resolution.\nThis means that if your Trim a 1920x1080 texture by 100 pixels from the left, you'll end up with a 1820x1080 texture.\nTherefore the Trim node is destructive. A non-destructive solution would be the Crop node."
          }
        },
